  "job": "Never stops moving: every stride she runs loads her next throw.",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "lore": "Ulkro has never stood still long enough to be asked where she is from. The Hourless say she was born on the rim road, between one footstep and the next, and she does nothing to correct them. She keeps a long spear-thrower on her left arm and a quiver of darts she calls the evening's worth, because she believes a throw is only as good as the ground you crossed before it. Stop her, and she is a hunter like any other. Let her run, and the dial itself begins to lean her way.",
